

About
~~~~~

Dtr!Drop is a simple kick door for FAME.
I made it just for fun a while ago, and now on my birthday,
I release it just for fun.


Installation
~~~~~~~~~~~~

Quite simple, even without using the installer:

Copy Dtr!Drop.Fim anywhere you want i.e. Doors:Desaster/Dtr!Drop/
and start your SystemEditor. Here create a BBSCMD called KICK,
enable all commands, set minium level to 250 or something, et voilà!


Usage
~~~~~

Just enter KICK <NodeNumber> in your bbs to make a fast kick.
If you just start KICK w/o the node number it will show you the
WHO door, so you can look who's online who shouldn't :)


Credits
~~~~~~~

Dtr!Drop v0.5 was written by Tolpan/Desaster.


