Short History
~~~~~~~~~~~~~

- 03/03/98 [Version 0.5] .. First release.
                            Removed "FUCK OFF SUCKER" message at kick.

- 12/02/98 [Version 0.4] .. Dtr!Drop now prints the handle of the user
                            who gets kicked.

- 03/07/97 [Version o.3] .. Now Ton!Kick is called Dtr!Drop. Reads now
                            the first argument as nodenumber to kick
                            (i.e. KICK 1). If you call it with an
                            argument it will suppress the WHO door output.

- 05/06/97 [Version o.2] .. Now Ton!Kick really kicks a user if one is
                            found on the kick node.. (user will get a
                            message "FUCK OFF SUCKER!" and than the dtr
                            will be dropped)

- xx/06/97 [Version o.1] .. Quick thing which just calls who door and
                            checks if a node is online or not.


